I do.

207
00:11:07,630 --> 00:11:08,590
They're all still back there.

208
00:11:09,050 --> 00:11:12,930
So you didn't need to have them taken out or pulled?

209
00:11:13,190 --> 00:11:15,570
No, as my dentist likes to say, I have a big mouth.

210
00:11:16,580 --> 00:11:18,020
Which in English has two meanings.

211
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:23,280
A big mouth is not just a large mouth, but also it means you like to talk a lot.

212
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:24,720
Right.

213
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:28,520
So, but did you ever have braces for example when you were a kid?

214
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:29,520
Oh yes.

215
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:30,520
Oh you had braces.

216
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:40,280
I had a retainer, which is a device that you, it looks like a line across your teeth and you put it in usually at night, but sometimes during the day and it makes some space in your mouth.

217
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:41,640
But I also had braces after that.

218
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:42,640
I hated braces.

219
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:43,840
I had them for two years.

220
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,340
Why did you hate braces?

221
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:46,340
Because they're uncomfortable.

222
00:11:46,340 --> 00:11:53,840
Well, they don't look very good, especially when you're a 13 year old girl and you want to look cute and you have this big metal thing in your mouth.

223
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,100
That's right.

224
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,840
Did you have braces?

225
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:56,280
No, no, I never had braces.

226
00:11:56,840 --> 00:12:00,200
Actually it was kind of for a while, I think a lot of people thought it was cool to have braces.

227
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:01,860
I did not grow up where you grew up.

228
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,720
It was not cool where I grew up.

229
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:04,300
I don't know.

230
00:12:04,880 --> 00:12:10,140
I think, or it gets to a point where in certain parts, I guess my school was filled with kids that had braces.

231
00:12:10,560 --> 00:12:11,900
So I guess everyone just had really bad teeth.

232
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:16,100
So obviously the people that didn't have braces kind of were left aside.

233
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:18,000
So you're like, oh, I want braces.

234
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:19,100
I want to be part of the group.

235
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:23,640
I know sometimes I wish I had glasses, because everyone I know has glasses.

236
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:24,640
Really?

237
